                <l xml:id="m-c6b44888-8133-4042-9eea-856306d7a12e" facs="#m-803a79d1-32ce-4ded-9faf-9b34bcdcb5d9" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-8e61b1ff-f5a9-4757-8dd7-3eeb76e18fea" facs="#m-13ebe060-12eb-43e8-9aab-e308ae7c7fdf" label="ambiguous">371</l><l xml:id="m-b117ef1e-b2ee-4adb-8e8b-9262ae3c1ff1" facs="#m-5959bdad-6628-471f-b14e-d6f362c891ed" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto. Sic-ut</l><l xml:id="m-d348d666-ec3c-4e68-b793-8bfc63224c6d" facs="#m-58a5fee8-39bb-481f-80a2-a1b515730cba" label="lyrics-like">érat in princi-pi-o, et nunc, et semper,</l><l xml:id="m-2b2e1c37-aee3-4d10-8c8c-3ddde74bb058" facs="#m-f9ed1947-318e-4e89-a727-ee33c84677eb" label="lyrics-like">et in saécula</l><l xml:id="m-50fc2635-6fec-4ff6-86b7-7aee7ead6cb1" facs="#m-38571bfa-ddf0-42b6-92d4-4fe0c65a39ec" label="lyrics-like">saecu- lórum. A-men.</l><l xml:id="m-b3d4d256-ebd7-4f00-add4-d58a78392b56" facs="#m-73e5d5a4-c3ef-4756-9148-1c3190961255" label="text-like">The Choir:* Venite. The Cantors : Christus. The Choir: * Venite.</l><l xml:id="m-edd5742d-dbcd-4152-9d74-cc8cd4c6825c" facs="#m-635906b1-caf3-41a0-9941-e557f8d71610" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Jésu, Redémptor ómnium. p. 365.</l><l xml:id="m-cd2d8139-5dd7-4f4a-a8db-551821555319" facs="#m-32024643-39ba-4e51-8a98-0e990ab44aaa" label="ambiguous">IN Ist NOCTURN.</l><l xml:id="m-a0416f31-1c41-435a-a9ce-6865d3a97771" facs="#m-72756deb-9c43-458e-ab2b-6f625222bba6" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-fd131721-7bee-4998-98d5-adfd2875ec18" facs="#m-4750cb31-bdb5-4d8c-98c4-e4d7bc6071ac" label="ambiguous">8.e</l><l xml:id="m-ccd2b8ae-d2d0-4523-a8ff-de0db9cf4834" facs="#m-7a265eb6-3dce-4596-be70-ab27c0564942" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-a497b21a-8a4f-4b58-bf3c-839b9d92bc63" facs="#m-1baa6d97-3395-4c9b-a571-5dc62dcb3c2a" label="lyrics-like">Omi-nus “ dí-xit ad me: Fí-li-us mé-us es tu,</l><l xml:id="m-bb1cd0d1-04e0-45fc-84c8-94125f04919f" facs="#m-80d05c4a-558a-4dda-9b69-17d7bcbb7611" label="lyrics-like">é-go hó- di- e gé- nu- i te.</l><l xml:id="m-9dbf9d4c-710d-41d0-8007-6e52ebcaad0a" facs="#m-ce6f6410-3cc9-4f97-b1fd-2152c2e572ec" label="ambiguous">Psalm 2.</l><l xml:id="m-43c7aeeb-41d6-44d2-99bf-2763a9a9f18d" facs="#m-14b1e3f5-3140-485c-8318-5810add531bf" label="lyrics-like">1. Quare fremu-érunt gén-tes, * et pópu-li medi-tá-ti sunt</l><l xml:id="m-d17e90ce-9308-4f0a-a03b-6e5cd8cab4b3" facs="#m-e31a5136-128f-4d37-9fec-14cdbeb51554" label="lyrics-like">ináni-a?</l><l xml:id="m-4501a008-3db7-4e7c-aaf5-73f7ee7223f3" facs="#m-61926b65-0383-4617-82e4-5e582bb642da" label="lyrics-like">2. Astitérunt réges térrae, et principes convenérunt in únum, * ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-70a4e06d-e38b-4279-b27f-8e076ab2bf8c" facs="#m-136f0147-edad-476e-89e3-f7e403894378" label="lyrics-like">vérsus Dóminum, et advérsus Christum éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-12088b77-728a-411a-8ecd-37928cd89536" facs="#m-50ade925-4841-48b1-877c-0d4e238844ba" label="lyrics-like">3. Dirumpámus víncula eórum:* et projiciámus a nóbis júgum ipsó¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8602128-6061-4670-8611-cb1c332347b8" facs="#m-c1f44c3f-5c64-47a4-b735-367586d0c231" label="ambiguous">rum.</l><l xml:id="m-d9526e97-e262-42be-af73-5b0dbec515da" facs="#m-9da8791e-0182-4c85-8442-f8b3bf3b2070" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui hábitat in caélis, irridébit éos: * et Dóminus subsannábit éos.</l><l xml:id="m-0534de2b-d606-4832-b505-2121766202e4" facs="#m-4715dcfd-11fb-405c-8a72-273d74c955fd" label="lyrics-like">5. Tunc loquétur ad éos in ira súa. * et in furóre súo conturbáhit éos</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>